                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Don't let yourself be fooled by the screenshots. This game isn't just a messy colour-chaos. It's actually a quite challenging game. It's a collection of almost dark-souls-like bossfights that require very tactical gameplay, especially considering you can only be hit 3 times before you have to start over. I'm only in my third bossfight so far but up until now i had to use well timed blocks to deflect orbs shot at me and even a giant space-ghost that was trying to ram me. The more bosses you defeat, the more abilities you seem to unlock which you definitely will need for your next bossfights.\nIn my opinion for 5€ definitly a game worth trying out.",
